---
// src/components/sections/Process.astro

const phases = [
  { 
    step: "01", 
    title: "Research & Discovery", 
    icon: "🔍",
    desc: "The initial stage of cooperation is critical. Stakeholder interviews, workshops, brainstorming, insights into user needs, use cases, and prototyping are all part of this process." 
  },
  { 
    step: "02", 
    title: "Product Design (UX & UI)", 
    icon: "🎨",
    desc: "We create clickable wireframes and mockups so you can see how your product will look and function. We care about our customers and deliver products that they will enjoy, using a human-centered approach." 
  },
  { 
    step: "03", 
    title: "Product Implementation", 
    icon: "⚙️",
    desc: "This is the most fundamental aspect of the overall development process. We begin engineering after planning all of the projects for short sprints. We always use the appropriate technology stack for your project's requirements." 
  },
  { 
    step: "04", 
    title: "Optimisation", 
    icon: "🔗",
    desc: "Following the development process, we must ensure that resources were used effectively. As a result, we conduct code reviews, refactoring, and optimization. At this point, we ensure that there are no bottlenecks in the code and that the app runs smoothly." 
  },
  { 
    step: "05", 
    title: "Quality Assurance", 
    icon: "🎖️",
    desc: "Before we deliver the project, we must be certain that each feature works as it should. Our QA engineers run manual and automated tests while researching all of the user stories." 
  },
  { 
    step: "06", 
    title: "Deploy & Monitoring", 
    icon: "🎯",
    desc: "The last stage of development. Everything we've previously built is deployed here. Our project is now open to the public. Typically, we continue to work with you after the product has been delivered and assist you at every stage of your business's development." 
  }
];
---

<section class="py-24 lg:py-32 bg-brand-dark relative border-t border-white/5 overflow-hidden">
    
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 mb-32">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
            
            <div class="relative w-full aspect-square md:aspect-[4/3] lg:aspect-square max-w-md mx-auto lg:max-w-none">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-accent/10 rounded-[2rem] translate-x-4 translate-y-4 -z-10 blur-lg"></div>
                <img 
                    src="/assets/Zeeshan.png" ,

                    alt="Zeeshan Ali - CEO & Founder" 
                    class="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl border border-white/10"
                    loading="lazy"
                />
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
                <h3 class="font-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6">
                    "Guiding Product Success with Expertise and Precision Software Engineering."
                </h3>
                
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed mb-8">
                    At ZetaLogix, we harness our technical and industry knowledge to provide insightful strategies for making your product both successful and profitable. I'm proud of our team's strong product-focused approach. With skilled developers on board, we prioritize not only exceptional code quality but also the tangible value we bring to every project from the very beginning of our partnership.
                </p>

                <div class="text-sm tracking-wide">
                    <span class="font-bold text-white">Zeeshan Ali</span>
                    <span class="text-slate-500"> - CEO & Founder</span>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 border-t border-white/5 pt-20">
        
        <div class="text-center mb-20">
            <h2 class="font-heading text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-brand-accent uppercase mb-3">Our Process</h2>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white">Work Phases</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-16 gap-y-16">
            {phases.map((phase) => (
                <div class="flex flex-col">
                    <div class="text-3xl mb-4 grayscale-[0.2]">
                        {phase.icon}
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white/10 tracking-tighter select-none">
                            {phase.step}
                        </span>
                        <h4 class="font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-white">
                            {phase.title}
                        </h4>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base">
                        {phase.desc}
                    </p>
                </div>
            ))}
        </div>
        
    </div>
</section>